<title>LEBANON: Lebanon October trade deficit $601 mln, up $71 mln.</title>
<headline>Lebanon October trade deficit $601 mln, up $71 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit rose $71.1 million to $601.0 million in October from $529.9 million a month earlier, the Bank of Lebanon said in its latest monthly bulletin on Friday.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Oct 96     Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		     91.6	 100.1	  82.1</p>
<p>    Imports		    692.6	 630.0	 665.4</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -601.0	-529.9	-535.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    833.6	 745.5	 666.7</p>
<p>    Imports		  6,149.6     5,480.6     6,079.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -5,316.0    -4,735.1    -5,412.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
